      <title>OnAirMic 1.0.0 (10)</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:08:29 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <link>https://onairmic.com</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;OnAirMic now keeps itself up to date.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic updates: OnAirMic checks for a new version once a day and can download and install it for you.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check for Updates… in the OnAirMic menu, in Settings › Updates, and by right-clicking the menu bar item.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Settings › Updates lets you turn automatic checks and automatic installs on or off.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
